__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
# Excel lock files, created while the table is open in Excel.
~$*
tmp.csv
# Atomic-write temporaries; a crash mid-write can leave one behind.
*.tmp

# `wzmn.bib` used to be listed here. It matched nothing -- the build output is
# overleaf/Wzmn.bib, inside the submodule, which this file does not govern --
# but with core.ignorecase=true on macOS it would have silently ignored a
# root-level Wzmn.bib if the output ever moved back.

# Deliberately NOT ignored, though they are generated:
#   identity.json         harvested identifiers. Losing it means re-resolving
#                         every paper and re-confirming every fuzzy match.
#   resolve_attempts.json retry counts, so a fresh clone does not restart the
#                         backoff for entries that have failed many times.
#   .pipeline_state.json  input hashes that drive the step auto-skip.
#   WORKLIST.md           so open items are browsable on GitHub.
